- 2021-02-09: diag_mass=0.005, top5_mass=0.045, entropy=0.995
- 2021-09-28: diag_mass=0.005, top5_mass=0.045, entropy=0.995
- 2022-12-30: diag_mass=0.005, top5_mass=0.046, entropy=0.995

